  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5802.16 Owner",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5802.16 “Owner” means the person or business entity that owns, leases or is otherwise primarily responsible for the registration, operation and maintenance of the subject vehicle.\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
